      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAXIMUM SUNSET (2) scored two back then drifted back and missed the frame latest finishing a 9 length 6th at this track (22.81). Has ability and is a key runner. LEKTRA SOLO (1) had the drop on the lead early on but could only manage third, beaten 4.5 lengths (22.47) at this track in a Grade 5 over 390m. Boasts a strong record from this draw with two wins and two minor placings from five starts. Leading chance. KENSINGTON GIRL (3) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 3.5 lengths at Geelong in a handy 22.72 beating Serenity Girl. Bold showing expected again. ASTON CHANT (8) is worth including after a top-three finish as favourite most recently.",
